From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 12:20:32 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] hw/virtio-media: let host-nv12 scale the frame down to the
 display (host-max-width)

qemu 11.1.2 port of
meta-xt-qemu/recipes-qemu/qemu/qemu/0246-v10-hw-virtio-media-let-host-nv12-scale-the-frame-down-to-the-display.patch;
that patch's description has the reasoning and the measurements.

Assisted-by: Claude Code:claude-opus-5-5
Signed-off-by: Yuichi Kusakabe <yuichi_kusakabe@jp.honda>
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [depends on the downstream virtio-media device (0216), which upstream qemu does not have]
---
 hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl-stub.c    |   1 +
 hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.c         |  38 ++++--
 hw/virtio/virtio-media.c               | 159 +++++++++++++++++++++++--
 include/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.h |  13 +-
 include/hw/virtio/virtio-media.h       |  20 ++++
 5 files changed, 203 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl-stub.c b/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl-stub.c
index 6494912ad..64c8d81d3 100644
--- a/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl-stub.c
+++ b/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl-stub.c
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ void *virtio_media_gpu_import(int dmabuf_fd, uint32_t width, uint32_t height,
 void *virtio_media_gpu_import_nv12(int dmabuf_fd, uint32_t src_width,
                                    uint32_t src_height, uint32_t stride,
                                    uint32_t uv_offset, uint32_t dst_width,
+                                   uint32_t dst_height, float scale,
                                    uint32_t len, int matrix, int *err)
 {
     close(dmabuf_fd);
diff --git a/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.c b/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.c
index 9bdc3f498..5ec4e01c9 100644
--- a/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.c
+++ b/hw/virtio/virtio-media-virgl.c
@@ -74,6 +74,8 @@ typedef struct VirtIOMediaGpuBuf {
